replacement that serves discs from the files on its SD card. Swiss and
libogc2 read and write the card through its commands (B2 read, B9/BC and
BA/BD write), and it serves up to two discs from fragment tables of at most
40 entries (B3), as its API describes (github.com/danielkraak/GC-Loader,
API.md). Until a table is in use the inserted disc is served, as a GC Loader
